                                                "sense_id": "1a3fc6eb-bf93-35b6-a233-2de91db284da",
                                                "text": "These two stood in the corridor, waving till the last of the platform was out of sight; then they came into our compartment, and the woman cried a little. Soon she dried her eyes, and went back into the corridor, to have a last glimpse of her native heath."
                                            }
